{"id": "div-credential-eq", "class": "divergence:credential-eq", "input": "credential=topsecretvalue123", "expected_ts": "credential=[REDACTED]", "expected_py": "credential=topsecretvalue123", "rationale": "TS intentionally masks `credential=<value>` (safer side; BEAD #13 REFUTED weakening). The Python SSOT KEYED_SECRET_RE omits `credential`, so it preserves the value. Encoded as separate per-side expectations rather than a single oracle."}
